effect_description = "A well-warded sanctuary, a good harvest, and a stag that has learned to trust the place enough to stay -- three unrelated proofs the habitat is thriving, not just built. Second upgrade in this structure's chain (upgrade_tier=2, Formula 1: 60 -> 108 gold, 12 -> 22 Common). Mechanical effect not yet wired (see design/gdd/building-upgrade.md Rule 6/7) -- same disclosed scaffolding-only status as upgrade_habitat_expansion_bountiful and upgrade_watchtower_reinforced."
